## 5. ClickUp Workspace Hierarchy

```mermaid
graph LR
    S["🏢 Space<br/>(Client Name)"] --> F["📁 Folder<br/>(Project Name)"]
    F --> L["📋 List<br/>(Dept: Art, Anim, VFX, UI...)"]
    L --> T["✅ Task<br/>(Individual work item)"]
```

| Level | Meaning | Example |
|-------|---------|--------|
| **Space** | 1 khách hàng = 1 Space | `Gameloft`, `VNG`, `Garena` |
| **Folder** | 1 dự án = 1 Folder | `Dragon Legends - Season 2` |
| **List** | 1 phần việc = 1 List | `Art`, `Animation`, `VFX`, `UI` |
| **Task** | 1 task cụ thể | `Design Dragon Boss Sprite` |

**ClickUp Statuses:**
```
NEW REQUEST → WIP → LEAD_CHECK → CLIENT_REVIEW → APPROVED → CLOSED
                         ↓              ↓
                        FIX ←───────── FIX
                                              CANCELLED (any time)
```

| Status | Meaning | Who acts |
|--------|---------|----------|
| `NEW REQUEST` | Task mới tạo | PM |
| `WIP` | Đang làm | Dev |
| `LEAD_CHECK` | Lead kiểm tra | Lead |
| `CLIENT_REVIEW` | Gửi khách duyệt | Client |
| `APPROVED` | Khách duyệt OK | — |
| `FIX` | Cần sửa lại | Dev |
| `CLOSED` | Hoàn thành | — |
| `CANCELLED` | Hủy bỏ | PM |

